title: "RAG Quality Engine: An Evaluation-First Platform for Retrieval-Augmented Generation Quality"
version: "0.2.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21805398
date-released: 2026-08-06
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: "RAG Quality Engine is an open-source software project for building, testing, and observing retrieval-augmented generation systems. It provides deterministic offline workflows for document ingestion, lexical/vector/hybrid retrieval, grounded answer generation, citation validation, evaluation metrics, trace persistence, a FastAPI service, a command-line interface, and notebook-based analysis."
